{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","人为财死"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","移动一段距离并为周围友军持续回复能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","移动至多1格，并在抵达目的地后持续抛洒金币，使周围2格范围内的其他友军回复共250 + 30点能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","恢复能量提升至260 + 30点。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","恢复能量提升至280 + 30点。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","恢复能量提升至300 + 30点。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","恢复能量提升至320 + 30点。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","妙手摊贩"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","布置“生命药剂”为低生命值友军回复生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，在自己的推车上布置2瓶“生命药剂”。自身周围2格内的其他友军在生命值百分比低于50%时，会自动使用1瓶“生命药剂”并回复其40% + 4%的最大生命值，回复量最高不超过自身800% + 65%攻击力。每个友军每6秒至多使用1瓶“生命药剂”。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":75,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":96,"end":102,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“生命药剂”回复量提升至42% + 4%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，在推车上额外布置1瓶“能量药剂”，自身周围2格内的其他友军在能量高于600时，会自动使用“能量药剂”，回复400点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“生命药剂”回复量提升至45% + 4%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","鸭尔兹"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使唤布拉达克一世对一名敌人造成伤害并吸收其能量，或补充一瓶“生命药剂”。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使唤布拉达克一世攻击一名敌人，造成150% + 20% ATK的伤害，并吸收目标70点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","若“生命药剂”消耗完毕，本次“鸭尔兹”不再攻击敌人，而是会使唤布拉达克一世为推车补充1瓶“生命药剂”。每3次“鸭尔兹”中至多有一次触发本效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至190% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，布拉达克一世补充“生命药剂”之前进一步提升急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高7点急速。且当“鸭尔兹”首次补充“生命药剂”之前，额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高10点急速。且当“鸭尔兹”首次补充“生命药剂”之前，额外提升8点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速。且当“鸭尔兹”首次补充“生命药剂”之前，额外提升10点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","大酬宾"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","布置超级“生命药剂”为友军回复大量生命值并永久提高护甲和魔抗。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗一次，在售出3瓶“生命药剂”之后，罗万会布置1瓶超级的“生命药剂”。该“生命药剂”回复使用者60%最大生命值，并且永久提升其30%的护甲和魔抗。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","该“生命药剂”回复使用者65%最大生命值，并且永久提升其35%的护甲和魔抗。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗1次，布拉达克一世补充“生命药剂”时，变为补充1瓶超级的“生命药剂”。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该“生命药剂”回复使用者70%最大生命值，并且永久提升其40%的护甲和魔抗。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“妙手摊贩”布置的“生命药剂”数量提升。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“妙手摊贩”在战斗开始时布置的“生命药剂”的数量提升1瓶。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","罗万将“能量药剂”升级为超级的“能量药剂”，与原“能量药剂”使用方式相同，但补充能量后还会使目标攻击力提升30%，持续6秒。佩吉在场时，额外为她提供一瓶超级的“生命药剂”。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","行运摇摇杖"]]}